      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "IDEAL TAO (9) drew wide last start and was never a genuine threat, beaten 22 metres into seventh at Parkes over 1660m. May just need a bit of luck at some point from this difficult draw. Meets a similar quality field and is good enough to take out a race like this. LADY ALLEGRA (8) produced a better effort last start when runner-up over 1730m at Bathurst, beaten 1.75 metres after racing handy then finding the lead only to be bloused late. Drawn to enjoy a cosy run but might need things to go her way at some stage. Primary contender in a similar assignment. NEVERTOOLATE (10) disappointed last time when eighth over 1720m at this track. Can make amends. NOTTADOUBT (6) is in the mix following a respectable second at his most recent appearance over 1740m at Riverina Paceway.",
